{"id":"en_after-hours-with-my-clueless-boss","title":"After Hours With My Clueless Boss","titleEn":"After Hours With My Clueless Boss","description":"Sophia Smith walks away from an arranged marriage and throws herself into her job, only to watch her boss Ethan, a sheltered rich kid, run his company into the ground. Their paths cross again at a nightclub, where she finds him working a second job as a male escort. Disguised with makeup and an alias, she steps in to help him without revealing who she is. The teasing that follows opens her eyes to sides of Ethan she never expected.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/after-hours-with-my-clueless-boss/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/after-hours-with-my-clueless-boss/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Second Chance","The Comeback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtplk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_after-hours-with-my-clueless-boss_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtplk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_after-hours-with-my-clueless-boss_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtplk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_after-hours-with-my-clueless-boss_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtplk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_after-hours-with-my-clueless-boss_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtplk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","